    "No labels exist, so three unsupervised detectors with different assumptions (Isolation Forest: isolation depth; LOF: local density;\n",
    "robust Mahalanobis: elliptical multivariate distance) are rank-averaged, and a **rule layer** catches hard business inconsistencies.\n",
    "Proxy validation (cancellations, late delivery, review score) is reported as proxy only."
