   "source": [
    "**Prediction time = moment of purchase.** Only information available then is used: promised delivery date (-> `est_days`), geography,\n",
    "distance, basket, price, freight, payment, calendar, and **seller history computed only from orders already delivered before this purchase**.\n",
    "Approval time, carrier handover and reviews are excluded (leakage) and only appear in a clearly labelled sensitivity run.\n",
    "`late = delivered > estimated`. Split is **temporal** (train on earlier 80% of purchase dates)."
   ]
  },
