    "5.8 Interpretation of SHAP analysis\n",
    "The SHAP analysis provides an explainability framework for understanding how individual input features influence model predictions.\n",
    "Rather than treating the machine-learning models as black boxes, SHAP estimates the contribution of each feature to the prediction relative to the model's expected output.\n",
