    "The market basket analysis indicates that 99.2% of orders contain products from a single category. Nevertheless, selected combinations, particularly Baby–Cool Stuff and Bed Bath Table–Home Comfort, demonstrate meaningful positive associations. These findings provide opportunities for targeted product recommendations and cross-selling initiatives, although their commercial significance requires further testing.\n",
